{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42774","headline":"寄高书记 · 刘兼","name":"寄高书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"齐朝庆裔祖敖曹，麟角无双凤九毛。\n声价五侯争辟命，文章一代振风骚。\n醉琴自寄陶家意，梦枕谁听益郡刀。\n补衮应星曾奏举，北山南海孰爲高。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}